  {
   "section": "za-section",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "Need to know more?"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "View FAQs"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "Hide FAQs"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "What is Zendesk?"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "Zendesk is an AI-first service platform powered by self-learning and the . With Zendesk, organizations can resolve customer and employee requests faster and more accurately across all channels, like email, messaging, live chat, phone, social, and help center. It brings conversations, context, and workflows into one intelligent system so teams can deliver real resolutions, not just close tickets."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "AI agents",
     "href": "/service/ai/ai-agents/"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 6,
     "text": "Zendesk Resolution Platform",
     "href": "/platform/"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 7,
     "text": "What is Zendesk AI?"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 8,
     "text": "is the intelligence that powers the helpdesk and the broader Zendesk service platform. With Zendesk AI you can:"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 9,
     "text": "Zendesk AI",
     "href": "/service/ai/"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 10,
     "text": "automate common requests,"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 11,
     "text": "help agents work faster with suggested replies and summaries,"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 12,
     "text": "route work more accurately,"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 13,
     "text": "and improve quality over time."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 14,
     "text": "Zendesk AI works best when you connect it to your real support data and keep your knowledge content up to date. Many teams start with AI assistance for agents, then expand to more automation as trust builds."
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 15,
     "text": "What is Zendesk Resolution Platform?"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 16,
     "text": "The is the full Zendesk service system, powered by Zendesk AI. It connects and your team members with core service tools like , helpdesk, , , and , so you can resolve issues end-to-end across all channels."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 17,
     "text": "Zendesk Resolution Platform",
     "href": "/platform/"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 18,
     "text": "AI agents",
     "href": "/service/ai/ai-agents/"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 19,
     "text": "ticketing",
     "href": "/service/ticketing-system/"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 20,
     "text": "knowledge",
     "href": "/service/knowledge/"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 21,
     "text": "analytics",
     "href": "/service/analytics/"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 22,
     "text": "quality assurance",
     "href": "/service/quality-assurance/"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 23,
     "text": "Zendesk AI Agents learn from each service interaction in what we call the Resolution Learning Loop™. Each new service interaction learns from the last, making self-service better, automation more efficient, and helping your team improve speed and quality over time."
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 24,
     "text": "What can you use Zendesk for?"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 25,
     "text": "Run an AI-powered customer service helpdesk across all channels"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 26,
     "text": "Zendesk allows teams to manage tickets and conversations from email, , , social, , and help center in one interface. Teams choose Zendesk for strong ticket organization, routing, collaboration, and reminders that keep work from slipping."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 27,
     "text": "chat",
     "href": "/service/ai/live-chat/"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 28,
     "text": "phone",
     "href": "/service/voice/"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 29,
     "text": "messaging apps",
     "href": "/service/messaging/"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 30,
     "text": "Manage self-service and build knowledge"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 31,
     "text": "Create internal and external and scale self-service with reusable knowledge and automation."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 32,
     "text": "help centers",
     "href": "/service/knowledge/"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 33,
     "text": "Support employees"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 34,
     "text": "Deliver , and shared services with structured workflows that guide requests through resolution."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 35,
     "text": "employee service for IT",
     "href": "/employee-service/itsm/"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 36,
     "text": "HR",
     "href": "/employee-service/human-resources/"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 37,
     "text": "Operate a service-focused contact center"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 38,
     "text": "Operate a service-focused contact center with voice and intelligent channel routing and reporting and performance insights that scale across every channel."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 39,
     "text": "Integrate service with the rest of your systems"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 40,
     "text": "Integrate Zendesk with your existing systems through prebuilt integrations and APIs to reduce manual work and speed up collaboration."
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 41,
     "text": "Does Zendesk offer standalone AI agents?"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 42,
     "text": "Yes. Zendesk offers self-improving AI agents that can work with your existing service platform, so you can automate service without switching your help desk or service stack. Today, this capability is available through ."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 43,
     "text": "Forethought by Zendesk",
     "href": "https://forethought.ai/"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 44,
     "text": "How is Zendesk different from traditional customer service software?"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 45,
     "text": "Traditional tools often stop at ticket tracking. Zendesk is built to help you resolve issues across all channels, with AI and automation built into the workflow."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 46,
     "text": "With Zendesk you get:"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 47,
     "text": "One unified workspace across channels so agents manage email, chat, phone, social, and messaging in one place."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 48,
     "text": "Automation you can tailor to your business (routing, triggers, workflows). This is powerful for complex operations, though it can take time to learn and tune."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 49,
     "text": "A platform approach with knowledge, analytics, QA, and integrations working together, instead of stitching separate tools together."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 50,
     "text": "Self-improving AI for real resolutions Zendesk AI is designed to get better over time. The Zendesk Resolution Learning Loop uses outcomes and service signals to improve automation, quality, and agent effectiveness."
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 51,
